WEBVTT

00:06:58.664 --> 00:07:02.126
you don't see any kind
of nitrate formation

00:07:02.168 --> 00:07:05.463
in these tropical pastures.

00:07:05.504 --> 00:07:08.424
In particular,
this tropical pasture grass.

00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:14.889
And also, you don’t see any nitrogen gas
emitted from these pastures.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:18.058
No nitrous oxide is emitted
from these pastures

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.729
because it controls
these bacteria so tightly

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:26.817
by producing large amounts of antibiotics
from the root systems.

00:07:27.485 --> 00:07:28.944
The question is,

00:07:28.986 --> 00:07:32.990
how do we bring this kind of ability
into our crop lands?